  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mines Advisory Group, MAG, Mines Iraq, 2013-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mines Advisory Group, MAG, Mines Iraq, 2013-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MAG implementerar sina minr&#xf6;jningsoperationer under 2013-2014 i syfte att undanr&#xf6;ja de humanit&#xe4;ra och socio-ekonomiska hindren som minor    utg&#xf6;r, i ett av v&#xe4;rldens mest mint&#xe4;ta l&#xe4;nder, Irak. I norra Irak, d&#xe4;r projektet implementeras, kommer &#xe4;ven kapacitetsutveckling av den      regionala myndigheten som &#xe4;r ansvarig f&#xf6;r minr&#xf6;jning, IKMAA, att      inbegripas i projektet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAG implements its demining operations during 2013-2014 in order to   address the humanitarian and socio-economic barriers that mines pose, in one of the world&apos;s most contaminated countries, Iraq. In northern  Iraq, where the project is implemented, it will also focus on         capacity development of the regional authority responsible for        demining, IKMAA.</narrative>
  </description>
